7. Recommendations for Codomax

Create separate pages for internship domains.

Target student-focused keywords.

Publish useful educational blogs.

Clearly explain internship eligibility.

Improve the registration journey.

Display accurate certificate information.

Improve mobile usability.

Build genuine backlinks through relevant partnerships.

8. Conclusion

Competitor research shows that clear content, useful internship information, trust signals and simple application processes are important for student-focused platforms.

Codomax can strengthen its SEO strategy by improving content quality, keyword targeting and the student registration experience.

Research limitation: This is a qualitative comparison. Keyword rankings, backlink counts and conversion rates were not independently measured.
